<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Staples, Depot inch higher.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Staples, Depot inch higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in besieged merger partners Office Depot Inc and Staples Inc were in a shaky recovery before Tuesday's market open, regaining some of Monday's substantial losses related to the U.S. government's rejection of their $4 billion combination.</p>
<p>Before the market open, Office Depot added 3/4 to 17-7/8 while Staples traded at 23-3/8, up 1/8, though the slight gain was mixed with trade in-line with last night's close at 23-1/4.</p>
</text>
